[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766841775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104849#issuecomment-2766841775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104849","id":2766841775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k6qev","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T17:02:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T17:18:42Z","body":"I think it may be better to remove custom minimum size completely (and not only for Android).\r\nAnd also `popup_centered_clamped()` most likely will be more proper then `popup_centered()` (I see that the passed size is smaller than the default editor minimum size anyway, but it will be safer if something changes in the future).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766841775/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767126920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104849#issuecomment-2767126920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104849","id":2767126920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k7wGI","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T18:56:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T19:04:07Z","body":"> I think it may be better to remove custom minimum size completely (and not only for Android). And also `popup_centered_clamped()` most likely will be more proper then `popup_centered()` (I see that the passed size is smaller than the default editor minimum size anyway, but it will be safer if something changes in the future).\r\n\r\n@arkology The current minimum size looks fine on PC, which is why I only changed it for the Android Editor. Removing it completely makes sense for mobile since it doesn’t make much of a difference, but on tablets and PC, it’d just make things unnecessarily small as more space is available there.\r\n\r\n`popup_centered_clamped()` centers the window inside its parent window, while popup_centered() centers it on the screen. So in this case, `popup_centered()` seems like the right choice to me. It ensures the popup appears in the center, even if the parent (Project Settings dialog) is positioned to the side.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767126920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768178310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104849#issuecomment-2768178310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104849","id":2768178310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k_wyG","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T05:58:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T05:58:12Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 thanks for clarification. If the parent window is project settings, it will unfortunately not work.\r\nBut I think it makes sense t